<title>USA: Western Ohio names CEO interim president.</title>
<headline>Western Ohio names CEO interim president.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD, Ohio 1997-01-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Ohio Financial Corp said its board had named interim chief executive John Hickman as interim president.</p>
<p>The company made the announcement in a statement released Friday. Hickman, former executive vice president for financial operations, was named interim chief executive this month after the death of president and chief executive C. William Clark.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk, (212) 859-1610))</p>
